---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="What Are Your Hours? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's operating hours, flexible scheduling options, and extended care availability.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/diverse_children_sharing_toy_background.jpg" 
        alt="Hours and schedule" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">What Are Marietta Childcare's Hours?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Operating hours, flexible scheduling options, and extended care availability for families.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">What Are Marietta Childcare's Hours and Schedule?</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare understands that working families require flexible childcare hours. Marietta Childcare's operating hours accommodate the diverse schedules of Marietta families.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Regular Operating Hours</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare operates Monday through Friday from 6:30 AM to 6:30 PM. The operating hours at Marietta Childcare provide full-day care for working parents. Marietta Childcare's extended hours accommodate early morning drop-offs and evening pickups for families with demanding work schedules.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's location at 2040 MacLand Crossing Circle in Marietta, Georgia maintains consistent hours throughout the year. Families can rely on Marietta Childcare's predictable schedule for planning their work and family commitments.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Flexible Scheduling Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare recognizes that not all families need full-time care. Flexible scheduling at Marietta Childcare includes part-time enrollment options. Part-time care at Marietta Childcare allows families to customize their childcare schedule based on work arrangements and family needs.</p>
          <p>Drop-in care options at Marietta Childcare provide flexibility for families with irregular schedules. Families interested in part-time or drop-in care should speak with an enrollment advisor at Marietta Childcare to discuss available options and pricing.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">GA Pre-K Schedule</h2>
          <p>Georgia Pre-K at Marietta Childcare operates during the regular school year only. GA Pre-K hours at Marietta Childcare typically run from 8:00 AM to 3:00 PM. GA Pre-K at Marietta Childcare follows the public school calendar, including holidays and breaks.</p>
          <p>Extended care beyond GA Pre-K hours is available at Marietta Childcare for families needing additional supervision. Extended care at Marietta Childcare allows children to arrive before 8:00 AM or stay after 3:00 PM. Families should ask an enrollment advisor at Marietta Childcare about extended care options and pricing.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Summer Camp Schedule</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers summer camp programs during the summer months. Summer camp start and end dates at Marietta Childcare vary by location. Families should speak with the Marietta center director for specific summer camp dates and hours.</p>
          <p>Summer camp registration at Marietta Childcare starts in March for currently enrolled students and April for the general public. Summer camp at Marietta Childcare provides full-day programming with activities, field trips, and enrichment opportunities.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Before and After School Care</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides before and after school care for school-age children. Before school care at Marietta Childcare begins at 6:30 AM, allowing parents to drop children before school starts. After school care at Marietta Childcare operates until 6:30 PM, accommodating parents with extended work hours.</p>
          <p>Before and after school care at Marietta Childcare includes homework support, snacks, and recreational activities. Marietta Childcare's before and after school programs support children's academic success and provide safe supervision during non-school hours.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Daily Schedule and Routines</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains consistent daily schedules to support children's development. The daily schedule at Marietta Childcare includes structured learning activities, outdoor play, meals, and rest time. Marietta Childcare's daily routines are age-appropriate and support cognitive, social, and emotional development.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's schedule includes multiple meal and snack times throughout the day. Meals at Marietta Childcare are nutritionally balanced and accommodate dietary restrictions and allergies. Rest time at Marietta Childcare supports children's physical development and afternoon engagement.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pickup Locations and Extended Services</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides pickup services at select elementary schools in the Marietta area. Pickup locations for after school care at Marietta Childcare include Dowell Elementary, Hollydale Elementary, and Cheatham Hill Elementary. Marietta Childcare's pickup service eliminates the need for parents to arrange separate transportation from school.</p>
          <p>Families using Marietta Childcare's pickup service should coordinate timing with the center. Marietta Childcare's transportation service ensures children transition safely from school to the childcare center.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Holiday and Closure Schedule</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare observes standard holidays and may have scheduled closures. Families should ask about Marietta Childcare's holiday schedule when enrolling. Marietta Childcare provides advance notice of closure dates to allow families to plan accordingly.</p>
          <p>During school breaks and holidays, Marietta Childcare may offer special programming or modified schedules. Families should contact the Marietta center director for information about holiday hours and special programming.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Schedule a Tour</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to learn more about hours, scheduling options, and daily routines. Contact Marietta Childcare today to schedule a tour and discuss how Marietta Childcare can accommodate your family's schedule.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/enrollment-process" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's the Enrollment Process?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Solutions for Working Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/parent-communication" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Communicate with Parents?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
